WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:08.502
The spaceship stopped near Micro Planet.

2
00:00:08.503 --> 00:00:13.075
Lucy and Ringo put on gear.

3
00:00:13.076 --> 00:00:44.769
Ringo used the micro-blaster to shrink everyone.

4
00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:48.475
"We're all small now," Lucy said.

5
00:00:48.476 --> 00:00:52.481
"But Tiny is still the smallest!"

6
00:00:52.482 --> 00:01:01.568
Ringo rolled his eyes.

7
00:01:01.569 --> 00:01:10.777
Everyone shot down to Micro Planet.

8
00:01:10.778 --> 00:01:20.511
They dived into the ocean.

9
00:01:20.512 --> 00:01:22.706
Bot lit up a map.

10
00:01:22.707 --> 00:01:34.358
"The gravity machine is this way," she said.

11
00:01:34.359 --> 00:01:38.003
Something moved in the water ahead.

12
00:01:38.004 --> 00:01:41.564
It had lots of arms.

13
00:01:41.565 --> 00:01:45.103
"What is that?" Ringo asked.

14
00:01:45.104 --> 00:01:56.915
Bot scanned the animal. "An octopus."

15
00:01:56.916 --> 00:02:04.896
They moved carefully past the octopus. "Ahh!"

16
00:02:04.897 --> 00:02:07.571
Ringo cried. A

17
00:02:07.572 --> 00:02:10.501
white shark zipped by! "That

18
00:02:10.502 --> 00:02:14.143
was close!" Bot said. "The

19
00:02:14.144 --> 00:02:22.481
shark might come back," Ringo said. "I

20
00:02:22.482 --> 00:02:25.384
see a reef," Lucy said. "We

21
00:02:25.385 --> 00:02:31.397
can hide there." Everyone

22
00:02:31.398 --> 00:02:37.318
swam to the reef. There

23
00:02:37.319 --> 00:02:42.303
were colorful plants and fish. "Where

24
00:02:42.304 --> 00:02:46.786
is the machine?" Ringo asked. "It's

25
00:02:46.787 --> 00:02:50.464
just past this reef," PJ said. "We

26
00:02:50.465 --> 00:03:01.651
should hurry," Ringo said. Soon

27
00:03:01.652 --> 00:03:09.097
they swam out of the reef. Suddenly

28
00:03:09.098 --> 00:03:13.251
the sand below started to move. Ringo

29
00:03:13.252 --> 00:03:19.531
gulped. "What's happening?" Then—

30
00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:22.703
snap!

31
00:03:22.704 --> 00:03:26.962
A giant clam ate them!

